# Content model

Public site is **not** assembled from the page-component tree. Typed entities:

| Entity | Role |
|---|---|
| `ingest_items` | Raw imported sources (stage 1+); not public |
| `posts` | Work shown in practice sections (after materialize) |
| `events` | Happenings; fourth public section + homepage banner |
| `appearances` | Press / v tisku |

## Sections (provisional — taxonomy may change after keyword corpus)

| Code | Czech | Path | Entity |
|---|---|---|---|
| `ritualy` | Svatební rituály | `/svatebni-ritualy` | posts |
| `himmelhaus` | Himmelhaus | `/himmelhaus` | posts |
| `umeni` | Umění | `/umeni` | posts |
| `udalosti` | Události | `/udalosti` | events |

Himmelhaus is the house; Instagram handle is `@himmlhaus`.

`Section::work()` is the three post sections. `Section::all()` includes Události. Posts and event “Souvisí se” never use `udalosti`.

## Homepage

Visual layout is in `homepage.mdc`. Text is the next published current or upcoming event, else the latest post. The five hero photos are a mock for now. Then three work-section plots (not Události), one photo above the text in each.

## Events

Public listing at `/udalosti` (nadcházející / proběhlé). Detail at `/udalosti/{slug}`. Optional related work section + Instagram `url`. Admin **Události**: create/edit with optional Instagram URL (“Načíst z Instagramu”).

## Import

Load into ingest via Katu jobs first (see `ingest.mdc`). Do not write public `posts` from refresh jobs.
